1
00:00:00,174 --> 00:00:03,884
Ten metres of sea rise,
and India's coastline gets redrawn.

2
00:00:03,944 --> 00:00:07,794
The Sundarbans, the delta shared
with Bangladesh, would go first.

3
00:00:07,965 --> 00:00:09,575
It is barely above sea level.

4
00:00:09,605 --> 00:00:12,655
Kolkata sits only a few
metres above the sea.

5
00:00:12,691 --> 00:00:14,201
Large parts of it would flood.

6
00:00:14,316 --> 00:00:19,176
Mumbai's southern end is built largely on
reclaimed land and would be badly exposed

7
00:00:19,176 --> 00:00:19,846
too.

8
00:00:19,892 --> 00:00:21,702
Ten metres is an extreme case,

9
00:00:21,932 --> 00:00:25,202
but even small rises make
cyclone floods worse today.

10
00:00:25,272 --> 00:00:27,742
Mumbai or Kolkata, which city goes first?

11
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:28,482
Comment.

